\fs22\expnd0\expndtw-1\cf1\lang1033\langfe11274\langnp1033\insrsid12278638\charrsid8200135 \'93The slump of the 1930, and the crisis today\'94,}{\fs22\cf1\lang1033\langfe11274\langnp1033\insrsid12278638\charrsid8200135 
 International Socialism n 121, London, January 2009.
