\fs22\lang1033\langfe11274\langnp1033\insrsid2182137\charrsid9837934 Foster John Bellamy, \'93The vulnerable planet fifteen years\'94 Monthly Review n 7, vol 61, december 2009}{\fs22\lang1033\langfe11274\langnp1033\insrsid2182137 .}{
